      "node_id": "n_001",
      "text": "The accused (Arjun) approached the victim (Meera) offering to sell a car.",
      "span": {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 73
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "n_002",
      "text": "He claimed that the car was in good condition and showed photos.",
      "span": {
        "start": 74,
        "end": 138
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "n_003",
      "text": "Based on this, Meera transferred ₹5 lakhs to Arjun via bank transfer.",
      "span": {
        "start": 139,
        "end": 208
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "n_004",
      "text": "Arjun promised delivery within 7 days.",
      "span": {
        "start": 209,
        "end": 247
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "n_005",
      "text": "After receiving the money, Arjun stopped responding.",
